              "reasoning": "NBRC885 identifies Difco Bacto Nutrient Broth at8g/L, with sodium carbonate separately added. OLS MICRO0000082 describes the Difco 3g beef-extract/5g peptone formula. This contradicts equating the input with Oxoid Nutrient Broth No.2; the existing No.2 owner's mixed supplier aliases require separation before reuse. ATCC3 primary formula now corroborates the Difco8g/L preparation and supports a concrete supplier/source-specific powder candidate, while the competingOxoidNo2 owner and liquid-ontology relation remain explicit integration conditions.",
