              "disposition": "stock_product_mixture_context",
              "reasoning": "TOGO M3216 uses 10 mL of 35% HCl in its trace-element stock. This source-specified acid reagent is not equated to pure dry/gaseous HCl. Its relation to nominal 25% and 32% preparations is unresolved because comparable percentage and material specifications are absent. The trace-element mixture and its water are not treated as the acid reagent recipe. Percent basis, solvent identity and supplied grade are unknown; no w/w, w/v, molarity or density is inferred. Successor-v3: Literal 25%, 32% and 35% are retained as source specifications, not normalized comparable fractions. The cited sources do not state a common percentage basis, carrier, grade or assay tolerance; the exact same-or-distinct preparation relation is unresolved. TOGO M2305/M2746 explicitly calls its 25% input concentrated, so that qualitative label does not exclude a numerical percentage. If comparable definitions and assay ranges were established, a real strength difference could be assessed; they are not established here. Before co-installing overlapping candidates, the coordinator must choose an explicit common bounded partial-material scope preserving every source context, or obtain comparable preparation/product evidence. No owner merge or arbitrary winner is selected.",
              "applicability": "All 1 full frozen occurrence snapshots and linked captured primary contexts were independently reread for case 87. TOGO M3216 uses 10 mL of 35% HCl in its trace-element stock. This source-specified acid reagent is not equated to pure dry/gaseous HCl. Its relation to nominal 25% and 32% preparations is unresolved because comparable percentage and material specifications are absent. The trace-element mixture and its water are not treated as the acid reagent recipe. This association is source-bound; raw generic labels remain nonresolving provenance unless explicitly the spelling-only seawater alias. Existing source occurrences only; W02 M2305/M2746 is comparative evidence and does not add its cases or occurrences to this proposal.",
